  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Dystopia was born as a need to express rave culture around the world. We started with custom designs for DGT prints on t-shirts and continue to grow to provide an infinite number of clothing for different styles of electronic music.</span><br><br><span>We love Hardcore and we were born with it. Our motivation is to create a brand so that all Hardcore, Hardstyle, Newstyle, Makina, Frenchcore and Techno lovers feel flattered.</span><br><br><span>All our products are taken care of in detail, from designs to production and we want it to remain that way. Always giving quality above anything.</span><br><br><span>Our dream? See how much you enjoy wearing our clothes at your favorite festival or rave.</span><br><br><span>We continue thanks and for you. Hardcore never dies.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Online<br>&bull; Payment terms: Monthly<br>&bull; Other information: No</p>\r\n</div>",
